---
flm:
  math: false
  use: [flmdoc]
  features:
    userdefs:
      macros:
        code:
          args: ['{']
          content: '`#1`'
        signature:
          args: ['{']
          content: '\docsignature{#1}'
        page:
          args: ['{']
          content: '\docref{#1}{the page}'
---
A code span \code{holding characters}, and one \code{holding \emph{markup}}.

\signature{\emph{markup}}

See \page{\emph{markup}}.
